     1289   DEFINE BUTTON b-invpay
     1290        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1291        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1292        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
